  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><hi rend="allcaps">Tenth Time.</hi><lb/>
               <placeName ref="namedentities.xml#haymarket">Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market</placeName>.<lb/>
               This <hi rend="allcaps">Evening</hi>, Saturday, <date when="1812-08-29">August 29, 1812</date>,<lb/>
               Will be perform'd a New Play in Three Acts, call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_look_at_home"><hi rend="allcaps">Look</hi> at <hi rend="allcaps">Home</hi>.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With New Scenery, Dresses, &amp;c.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Principal Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_terry">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Terry</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_salter">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Salter</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_kent">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kent</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_grant">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grant</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_grove">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mathews</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_finn">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_flowerdew">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Flowerdew</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_noble">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_williams">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Williams</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_grove">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_decamp">Miss De Camp.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_kendall">Mrs. Kendall.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ju_gl">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Glover</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Song</hi> in Act I. Composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ed_ho">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">C. Horn</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               The New Scenes designed and executed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#j_de">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">DeMaria</hi></persName> and Assistants.<lb/>
               The New Play of '<hi rend="allcaps">Look</hi> at <hi rend="allcaps">Home</hi>', is published, and may be had at the Theatre.<lb/>
               After whicht the Musical Piece of<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main" ref="namedentities.xml#play_purse">The <hi rend="allcaps">Purse</hi>;</title><lb/>
               <title type="sub">Or, The Benevolent Tar.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>The Baron,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ed_ey">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Eyre</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Edward,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_kent">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kent</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Theodore,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_flowerdew">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Flowerdew</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>William,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_bennett">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bennett</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Page,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_martin">Master <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Sally,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_williams">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Williams</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               To which will be added (First Time at this Theatre) the favourite Farce of The<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main" ref="namedentities.xml#play_doldrum">Doldrum;</title><lb/>
               <title type="sub">Or, 1819.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Marmaduke,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_sh_mu">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Munden</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Septimus,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mathews</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Captain Septimus,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_betterton_jun">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Betterton,</hi> Jun.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Captain Slash,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_williams">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Williams</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Flam,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_bennett">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Bennett</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Gyp,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_jones">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Looby,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_martin">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Drummer Boy,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_martin">Master <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Emmeline,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_bellchambers">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mrs. Anburne,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_williams">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Williams</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList></ab>
         </div>
